{"id":133399148989936,"name":"[HUGE UPD 🪨] Character Arena ","desc":"🌀 Character Arena\nStep into the action! Punch people to unlock new characters, each with unique abilities. Choose your fighter and show your skills in a fun and fast-paced arena.\n\n✨ Weekly updates bring fresh content and improvements.\n💬 Community feedback helps guide the game’s future.\n\n🎮 Controls:\n🖱️ Click – Punch\n-- KEYBINDS :\n1 – First Ability\n2 – Second Ability\n3 – Third Ability\n\nCan you rise to the challenge and become a legend in the arena?\n\nCredits to\nOliwier19500 (@Oliwier19500): Made most characters, made Animations and VFX\nPrestonD3v (@hellothere_123456jj): Made some Characters, Fixed bugs, UI, Animations, Cutscenes","path":"/game/133399148989936-character-arena","slug":"133399148989936-character-arena","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8e40626a38b5b3097d885d9793cd6133597bdb1b107f15d3680d083c378a8c86.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-726a0d5f74ed24ef5f249d485d83bfe3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":311170,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-05T12:12:11.967Z","creator":{"name":"Yoichi YC Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"HUGE-UPD-Character-Arena-Auto-punch-56626","_id":"68e2609b78c4375e46fcf26d","title":"Auto punch","game":{"_id":"68e2609b78c4375e46fcf269","gameId":133399148989936,"name":"[HUGE UPD 🪨] Character Arena ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":133399148989936},"features":"Auto punch player(add your nick name Instead of \"Your nickname is here\"","tags":[],"script":"while true do\n    local args = {\n        [1] = workspace:WaitForChild(\"Your nickname is here\")\n    }\n    \n    game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"PunchEvent\"):FireServer(unpack(args))\n    print(\"PunchEvent